% NY N362694 (July 2026): an epoxy resin key chain making kit from China.
% CBP: kit DM0030003 -> 3907.30
scenario ny_n362694 is, as stated in ruling NY N362694:
    kit DM0030003 is a set put up for retail sale,
        confer "is considered a set for retail sale based on GRI 3(b)".
    the epoxy resin of kit DM0030003 is a component of kit DM0030003,
        confer "The kit is comprised of a clear liquid two-component epoxy resin AB (resin plus hardener)".
    the kind of the epoxy resin of kit DM0030003 is liquid,
        confer "a clear liquid two-component epoxy resin AB (resin plus hardener)".
    the polymer of the epoxy resin of kit DM0030003 is epoxide resin,
        confer "a clear liquid two-component epoxy resin AB (resin plus hardener)".
    the silicone molds of kit DM0030003 is a component of kit DM0030003,
        confer "2 silicone molds".
    the glitter of kit DM0030003 is a component of kit DM0030003,
        confer "3 packets of colored glitter".
    the pigment of kit DM0030003 is a component of kit DM0030003,
        confer "2 bottles of pigment".
    the stirring rods of kit DM0030003 is a component of kit DM0030003,
        confer "2 stirring rods".
    the mixing cups of kit DM0030003 is a component of kit DM0030003,
        confer "2 mixing cups".
    the droppers of kit DM0030003 is a component of kit DM0030003,
        confer "2 droppers".
    the jump rings of kit DM0030003 is a component of kit DM0030003,
        confer "5 metal open jump rings".
    the keychains of kit DM0030003 is a component of kit DM0030003,
        confer "5 metal keychains".
    the essential character of kit DM0030003 is given by the epoxy resin of kit DM0030003,
        according to CBP, confer "with the essential character imparted by the epoxy resin".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of kit DM0030003 is 3907.30"].

% NY N271893 (February 2016): Duranol T5651 from Japan.
