% NY N302175 (February 2019): Hemicellulose Extract from Canada.
% CBP: the Hemicellulose Extract -> 3912.11
scenario ny_n302175 is, as stated in ruling NY N302175:
    % DISAGREES: CBP gives 3912.11 (cellulose acetates); the model gives
    % 3913.90 — the ruling describes a solution of hemicellulose, acetic
    % acid and water, recorded as a natural polymer; it says nothing that
    % makes the product a cellulose acetate.
    % hemicellulose: a natural polysaccharide, not a cellulose derivative
    the kind of the Hemicellulose Extract is solution,
        confer "Hemicellulose Extract is a solution of hemicellulose, acetic acid and water".
    the polymer of the Hemicellulose Extract is natural polymer,
        confer "Hemicellulose Extract is a solution of hemicellulose, acetic acid and water".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the Hemicellulose Extract is 3913.90"].

% NY N336497 (November 2023): hydroxypropyl methylcellulose phthalate and acetate succinate from Japan.
% CBP: the HPMC phthalate -> 3912.39; the HPMC acetate succinate -> 3912.39
scenario ny_n336497 is, as stated in ruling NY N336497:
    % the HPMC phthalate is Item 1; the HPMC acetate succinate is Item 2
    the kind of the HPMC phthalate is powder,
        confer "It is a colorless, odorless white powder".
    the polymer of the HPMC phthalate is cellulose ether,
        confer "Item 1 is noted to be hydroxypropyl methylcellulose phthalate".
    the kind of the HPMC acetate succinate is powder,
        confer "It is a white/off-white powder with a faint acetic acid odor".
    the polymer of the HPMC acetate succinate is cellulose ether,
