    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the HPMC phthalate is 3912.39", "the subheading of the HPMC acetate succinate is 3912.39"].

% NY N344420 (December 2024): cellulose in suspension from The Netherlands.
% CBP: Valida S191A plus -> 3912.90; Valida S231C -> 3912.90; Valida L -> 3912.90
scenario ny_n344420 is, as stated in ruling NY N344420:
    % Valida S191A plus is Valida S191A+. The polymer is cellulose itself:
    % VOCAB: cellulose, no listed polymer; cellulose derivative (the family of
    % heading 3912) used
    the kind of Valida S191A plus is suspension,
        confer "ultimately yielding a fibrillated cellulose suspension in water".
    the polymer of Valida S191A plus is cellulose derivative,
        confer "Each is an aqueous solution consisting of 2.5 percent to 10 percent cellulose".
    Valida S191A plus is in aqueous dispersion,
        confer "The request addressed cellulose in aqueous suspension".
    Valida S191A plus is claimed to belong to wood pulp of heading 4705,
        confer "you argue that the Valida products are chemically and mechanically processed wood pulp classifiable under subheading 4705.00.0000".
    the claim that Valida S191A plus belongs to wood pulp of heading 4705 is rejected,
        according to CBP, confer "The Valida products do not exist in these forms".
    the kind of Valida S231C is suspension,
        confer "ultimately yielding a fibrillated cellulose suspension in water".
    the polymer of Valida S231C is cellulose derivative,
        confer "Each is an aqueous solution consisting of 2.5 percent to 10 percent cellulose".
    Valida S231C is in aqueous dispersion,
        confer "The request addressed cellulose in aqueous suspension".
    Valida S231C is claimed to belong to wood pulp of heading 4705,
        confer "you argue that the Valida products are chemically and mechanically processed wood pulp classifiable under subheading 4705.00.0000".
    the claim that Valida S231C belongs to wood pulp of heading 4705 is rejected,
        according to CBP, confer "The Valida products do not exist in these forms".
    the kind of Valida L is suspension,
        confer "ultimately yielding a fibrillated cellulose suspension in water".
    the polymer of Valida L is cellulose derivative,
        confer "Each is an aqueous solution consisting of 2.5 percent to 10 percent cellulose".
    Valida L is in aqueous dispersion,
        confer "The request addressed cellulose in aqueous suspension".
    Valida L is claimed to belong to wood pulp of heading 4705,
        confer "you argue that the Valida products are chemically and mechanically processed wood pulp classifiable under subheading 4705.00.0000".
    the claim that Valida L belongs to wood pulp of heading 4705 is rejected,
        according to CBP, confer "The Valida products do not exist in these forms".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of Valida S191A plus is 3912.90", "the subheading of Valida S231C is 3912.90", "the subheading of Valida L is 3912.90"].

