    the Smart Hygiene AI Bidet is a composite good,
        confer "the toilet seat and lid with incorporated electronic bidet, is considered to be a composite good".
    the toilet seat of the Smart Hygiene AI Bidet is a component of the Smart Hygiene AI Bidet,
        confer "It is comprised of a toilet seat with an incorporated bidet".
    the kind of the toilet seat of the Smart Hygiene AI Bidet is lavatory seat,
        confer "this item could still perform the primary function of a toilet seat and lid".
    the bidet of the Smart Hygiene AI Bidet is a component of the Smart Hygiene AI Bidet,
        confer "a toilet seat with an incorporated bidet".
    the electronic control panel of the Smart Hygiene AI Bidet is a component of the Smart Hygiene AI Bidet,
        confer "an electronic control panel attached to the side of the toilet seat".
    the essential character of the Smart Hygiene AI Bidet is given by the toilet seat of the Smart Hygiene AI Bidet,
        according to CBP, confer "it is the opinion of this office that the toilet seat, and lid, provides this item with the essential character".
    subheading expects answers [].

