    the novelty eyeglasses is a manufactured article,
        confer "consists of novelty eyeglasses without lenses, suspenders, and a bowtie".
    the polymer of the novelty eyeglasses is polypropylene,
        confer "The eyeglasses are constructed from polypropylene plastic".
    the principal use of the novelty eyeglasses is novelty eyewear,
        according to CBP, confer "As the eyeglasses would be considered an article of plastic, and as it is not more specifically provided for elsewhere".
    the kind of the knit suspenders is suspenders,
        confer "The suspenders are constructed from 90% polyester and 10% elastane knit fabric".
    the fabric construction of the knit suspenders is knitted,
        confer "The suspenders are constructed from 90% polyester and 10% elastane knit fabric".
    the knit suspenders contains 90 percent of polyester,
        confer "The suspenders are constructed from 90% polyester and 10% elastane knit fabric".
    the knit suspenders contains 10 percent of elastane,
        confer "The suspenders are constructed from 90% polyester and 10% elastane knit fabric".
    the kind of the bowtie is bow tie,
        confer "The bowtie is constructed from 100% polyester knit fabric".
    the fabric construction of the bowtie is knitted,
        confer "The bowtie is constructed from 100% polyester knit fabric".
    the bowtie contains 100 percent of polyester,
        confer "The bowtie is constructed from 100% polyester knit fabric".

    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the novelty eyeglasses is 3926.90", "the subheading of the knit suspenders is 6212.90", "the subheading of the bowtie is 6117.80"].